The Director Research, Technology and Innovation (RTI) will be appointed by the Chief Executive. Recruitment will be as a member of the temporary staff of the Agency for a 3-year period. Renewal is possible only once for an additional period of 2 years, within the limits set out in the EDA Staff Regulations. The successful candidate will be recruited as Temporary Agent, grade AD14. In line with EDA's Staff Regulations, the Agency does not offer inter-Agency mobility.

